# Polite user prohibitions

When instructing **users** not to install unapproved plugins, add unapproved marketplace entries, or bypass the **Team Marketplace**, lead with **Please**.

Examples:

- *Please do not install unapproved plugins yourself.*
- *Please use the Team Marketplace or an admin-approved configuration instead of local workarounds.*

## Applies to

- Chat replies and user-facing guidance.
- Drafting prohibition text in `user-guide/` and `admin-guide/` (except verbatim Admin Panel rule quotes).

## Does not apply to

- Mandatory **Admin Panel** team-rule text quoted verbatim in the Administration Guide.
- Technical error messages, logs, or agent-to-agent/system instructions.
- Documentation outside `user-guide/` and `admin-guide/` (runbooks, product docs, delivery notes, and other department guides).
